12	All tools now automatically validate device connections and handle device_id intelligently.
13	- If no device_id is specified, tools will connect to the first available device
14	- Tools include built-in validation and clear error messages
15	- Never need to manually check connection state - tools handle it for you
16	
17	📱 **RECOMMENDED WORKFLOWS**
18	
19	**For device status and setup:**
20	1. `get_device_status()` - Get complete device readiness (recommended first step)
21	2. `connect_device()` - Establish connection with detailed validation
22	3. `unlock_screen()` + `screen_on()` - Prepare device for automation
23	
24	**For app management:**
25	1. `get_installed_apps()` - Auto-connects and returns complete app list
26	2. `start_app()` - Launch apps with validation
27	3. `get_current_app()` - Check foreground app
28	
29	**For UI automation:**
30	1. `wait_for_element()` - Wait for elements to appear
31	2. `click()`/`long_click()` - Interact with UI elements
32	3. `send_text()` - Input text with validation
33	4. `swipe()`/`drag()` - Perform gestures
34	
35	**For debugging:**
36	1. `dump_hierarchy()` - Get complete UI structure
37	2. `screenshot()` - Capture current screen
38	3. `get_element_info()` - Detailed element properties
39	4. `get_toast()` - Check system messages
40	
41	⚡ **SMART FEATURES**
42	- Automatic device connection management
43	- Built-in error handling and validation
44	- Detailed success/failure responses
45	- Clear guidance for troubleshooting
46	- No manual device ID management required
47	
48	🎯 **RESPONSE FORMAT**
