    """Get histogram statistics for a channel of the active layer.

    Parameters:
    - channel: "value" (all; default), "red", "green", "blue", "alpha"
    - image_index: Target image index (default 0)

    Returns: {mean, median, std_dev, min, max, pixels, count}
